WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:03.430
Strong technical rounds get you to the bar.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.968
The behavioral round decides the level.

3
00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:08.690
Offers are lost here more than in coding.

4
00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:13.115
Three tools: the STAR shape, a story bank, and the right scope.

5
00:00:13.135 --> 00:00:15.800
First: tell every story in one shape.

6
00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:16.625
Situation.

7
00:00:16.645 --> 00:00:17.150
Task.

8
00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:17.650
Action.

9
00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:18.300
Result.

10
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.985
In about two minutes.

11
00:00:20.005 --> 00:00:21.923
Spend most of the time on the action.

12
00:00:21.943 --> 00:00:23.420
That is your work.

13
00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.845
And say I, not we.

14
00:00:24.865 --> 00:00:27.330
The interviewer scores you, not your team.

15
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.380
End with a result that has a number.

16
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.140
Second: do not invent stories in the room.

17
00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.975
Prepare about 8 true stories before the loop.

18
00:00:35.995 --> 00:00:38.337
Each story can answer several questions.

19
00:00:38.357 --> 00:00:41.875
A conflict story also shows influence.

20
00:00:41.895 --> 00:00:44.285
Third: match the scope to the level.

21
00:00:44.305 --> 00:00:48.745
A mid-level story: I did the task I was given, and I did it well.

22
00:00:48.765 --> 00:00:54.070
A senior story: I found the problem, and I moved other teams to fix it.

23
00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:56.305
Last: tell me about a failure.

24
00:00:56.325 --> 00:00:57.505
Pick a real failure.

25
00:00:57.525 --> 00:00:58.355
Own your part.

26
00:00:58.375 --> 00:01:00.215
Do not blame other people.

27
00:01:00.235 --> 00:01:01.990
Then say what you changed after it.

28
00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.540
That change is the answer.

29
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.100
Quick recap of the behavioral round.

30
00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.275
Use the STAR shape.

31
00:01:08.295 --> 00:01:09.550
Prepare eight stories.

32
00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:12.110
And show scope beyond your own task.

33
00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:15.230
Now start the first lesson below.
